        "Web Bluetooth GATT Client streams ASCII control frames (M:L/R, A:Hz, L:Hz) to Smart Glasses",
        "Dual bilateral eccentric rotating mass (ERM) motors provide soothing neurological stimulation",
        "Built-in Demo Simulation Engine triggers Web Audio API tones and CSS pulse effects when disconnected"
      ]
    },
