      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Zero-Cloud Local Data Architecture",
      "items": [
        "Zero server-side database: all symptom logs, presets, and Gemini keys remain in client localStorage",
        "User Memory Engine mines local session history to personalize future prompt recommendations",
